        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Death Flash"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(light)\n\nWhen the caligni creeper dies, their body combusts in a flash of bright light. All creatures in a 10-foot emanation must succeed at a 17 Fortitude save or be blinded for 1d6 rounds. Creatures with light blindness who successfully save are still blinded for 1 round. The creeper's gear and treasure are left in a pile where they died. As this isn't a magical effect, the light has no effect within magical darkness."
            },
            "id": "9a16a367-ec66-46bd-8d18-833ad04938f4",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:50.064440"
            }
          }
        },
